<title>GREECE: ISOTIMIA PUBLISHER TESTIFIES ON DELTA SCANDAL.</title>
<headline>ISOTIMIA PUBLISHER TESTIFIES ON DELTA SCANDAL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investigating magistrate Costas Ganiatsos heard testimony on Tuesday by financial weekly Isotimia publisher Panagiotis Bousbourelis on the Delta Securities scandal that shook the Athens bourse.</p>
<p>&quot;I briefed the magistrate on the ways the scheme on shares of Magrizos was structured based on what I have been able to gather from investigative reporting. Mr. Ganiatsos will also call brokers that have done trades with Delta on shares of Magrizos to testify,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
